Dear 📍 Mykola,

It's Jack here from CMS Global, how are you? 

Are you available for long term B2B freelance opportunities at the moment?

I'm looking for a Senior Product Owner to work on a long term contract based full time in Brussels working for an EU Institution.

The daily rate for this role is €300 per day worked.


Responsibilities will include:

* Master’s degree in IT or relevant discipline, combined with a minimum of 13 years of relevant working experience in IT;
* At least 5 years of experience inSystem / Data / process modelling (UML & BPMN);
* At least 3 years of experience in Weblogic, or other JEE container, program or project management;
* Experience as Agile Scrum Master;
* Good knowledge of Middleware systems (e.g. Weblogic Application Server, Oracle Service Bus);
* Good knowledge of messaging services and platforms (e.g. Java Message Service, Apache Kafka);


Tasks will include:

* Develop program assessment protocols for evaluation and improvement;
* Maintain organizational standards of satisfaction, quality, and performance;
* Works within the agile process;
* Interacts and validates requirements with the business;
* Propose solutions by combining IT tools and business process refactoring or improvements based on an in-depth understanding of a specific business domain;
* Creates user stories and acceptance tests from themes and features granular enough for a single sprint;
* Participates to retrospectives, sprint and release planning, demos and other Scrum-related meetings;
* May perform the role of Scrum master.


Does this sound of interest to you?

Are you ok to work full time in Brussels?

Is the daily rate ok for you?

Are you ok to work as a freelancer?

If you are interested please send your CV and availability to start via LinkedIn

Many thanks for taking the time to read this 

Best Regards

Jack Nelhams
CMS Global Solutions Ltd
www.cmsglobalsolutions.co.uk

